ng  arrested they're not getting  nothing's happening to them  you know the biggest change that i saw  was hearing from agents all along the  border  from every different kind of agency that  they've never seen anything  in their lifetimes like they're seeing  now because the numbers are  up on every single part of the border  and perhaps  um and that's never happened before  there's always you know there have been  a number  of crises that have come and gone but in  all of those situations the  administration in washington  has acknowledged that there's a crisis  and has  taken action to mitigate what is  happening  that is not happening here in fact the  only action that has been taken  has been to create the crisis so it's  not that there's a lack of policy  it's that the policy is to open the  border  and it's not that there's a failure of  action the action has been  to open the border and obliterate um  immigration law  and to prevent law enforcement from  enforcing it so  texas has stepped in the breach here so  as arizona and new mexico  but there's just millions and millions  and millions of dollars  that are being spent the biden  administration is spending it  on immigrants and that has left national  security  and security up to the states  so texas is filling that gap and that's  what really you know  texas has filled in temporarily before  but there's always been some kind of  acknowledgement from washington  that you are in the midst of a crisis  and what kamila harris  has not done as so-called borders are  she hasn't spoken to the people who are  living on the border in  any of these states she hasn't been down  and visited any of these communities  she hasn't acknowledged any of these  problems she hasn't spoken to the  ranchers who  literally have gotten uh you know  they're just like a  highway of illegal immigrants who are  trying to avoid the law  i mean we we're talking about areas you  know where there's  never been people coming through i me